"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4482580","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1846651706690304","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello to anyone reading this. The store page has been updated with an official trailer and new art! I have been preparing for Steam Next Fest for quite some time now. For those who don't know, three times a year steam holds a Next Fest for mostly indie games. Any eligible game can sign up, but the catch is that you can only sign up once per game and never more no matter how many years pass. So this means this is my one and only shot at Next Fest. Which is why it's important I try my best to prom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:47:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1844751498219822","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Final True Ultimate Demo 3.12","summary":"OKAY. This is actually the true final demo update of 3.12. Worry not, I did not spend a month just doing demo stuff, I was implementing full game features. All of Matthew's rooms are pretty much done BUT. They are not in the demo on purpose. The purpose of this true final ultimate demo update of 3.12 is to implement a Fishing Minigame! That basically shows the core aspects of it all. Right now, it is completely pointless! You get nothing besides a cool soundtrack and how the fishing minigame mec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T23:19:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1842212951296569","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 3.03","summary":"TLDR:Narcissist Tail reached over 1000 wishlists! Woah.Pomfy most likely needs an extra month to work on NT.Map Creature Thing (Goopy) has proper tuning of difficulty and difficulty modes.Made Secret Boss easier to understand what to do.Next update will have Fishing Mini-Game for October Steam Next Fest.Next update is for preparation for October Steam Next Fest. Hi to anyone reading this. I'm posting a demo update, even though I think I said the last update was the very last update for the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T11:01:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296569","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1839676055881094","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"update","title":"Official 3.0 Demo Update","summary":"Hello to anybody and everyone reading this. I am confident that to say that the demo is officially really finally done. There will be no more updates for the demo after this (unless something soft-locks players). Everything I want to showcase is in here worth around 2 hours of gameplay. The demo holds about 20% of the full game, so this is quite an overkill. However, behind the scenes, it was mostly me establishing systems that I can maintain and streamline to the finish goal. I am happy to say ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T23:04:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1835236783565863","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.5 Mega Update","summary":"Narcissist Tail 1.5 Demo UpdateSo technically, the large chunk of this update was done about three weeks ago, but I wasn't confident to call it the 1.5 update because I knew there were going to be a lot of bugs. And I was right. Oh my god there were so many bugs.Thankfully I have a very disgustingly awesome community that play-tested plenty for me to find issues. I am sure this 1.5 Demo Update will continue to have bugs as my code is very. Not good. But there shouldn't be any game breaking bugs!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T13:12:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783565863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1830797770234182","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 1.25","summary":"Hi to anyone reading this. The last update post was 1.14 and I am talking about 1.25 now, so a lot of things have changed since then. The gist is that I fixed a lot of bugs revolving around Esc Menu and Starting Screen Menu. Esc Menu would be buggy in battle scenes. I added a Gore Censor that works as intended. The save system was also buggy because it had ONE incorrect line of referencing the old system. Which would wipe out the first save slot every time. Also tweaked a bunch of dialogue and a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T20:17:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770234182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4466110-1828441623111709","game_id":"steam-4466110","kind":"update","title":"1.14 Demo Patch","summary":"First time using an announcement. I've been doing updates for the past two weeks pretty consistently and have not said anything because I am new to all of this. I don't know who will be reading these, but I'll try my best to talk about updates. I have 450+ wishlists so this is crazy to me. Thanks everyone. ------------------------------------------------------------ CHANGED THE HEARTS. No longer using hearts not because I didn't want to look like undertale, but I realized if someone clipped my g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T09:49:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623111709","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4466110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4466110":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4466110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z"},"4482580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4466110","app_id":4466110,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d1832ff00bfc9bea6eaa06e71fc6c254b30a7a8eb703e09bfd8eddd2c70bdcd4","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You are a player who was called upon to help a strange wolf family escape. Figure out why they were kidnapped. Find hidden secrets with an in-game scree